the-firm-as-one-program-26 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-26 = unlines (cons "- **C3** Compute and knowledge accumulate instead of being redone ([P8: Dependency certificates, effect scopes and hot swapping of running code (hyperactivity v31 §10.1–10.5)], [P9: Content-addressed, decentralized exchange of code with its proofs (hyperactivity v31 §10.8)])." (cons "  A result computed once is a result for everyone who asks the same question, valid exactly as long as its recorded reads still hold. Large shares of research clusters now spend their cycles recomputing results that already exist somewhere unrecognized; that spending ends. More importantly, a relationship one researcher establishes becomes a construction others build on without re-establishing it and without fear that it means something different in their context." nil))
